reminder (because I forget)

dotfiles are managed with "yadm"

yadm is installed on mac using homebrew ("brew install yadm")

Check for updates using standard git commands:

    yadm status - see what has changed
    yadm add - add file to commit group
    yadm commit -m
    yadm push
    etc.
    etc.

For a clean install on a new or reverted machine:

```
yadm clone https://github.com/slowbluecamera/dotfiles.git
or
yadm clone -b oblio https://github.com/slowbluecamera/dotfiles.git
```

--
